{
  "id": "node-card:concept__physical-property",
  "node_id": "concept:physical-property",
  "card_layer": "backbone",
  "title": "物理性质",
  "pattern_refs": ["pattern:concept-core-v2"],
  "summary": "不需要发生化学变化就能表现出来的物质性质，如颜色、气味、熔点、沸点、密度、硬度等。",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "definition",
      "title": "定义",
      "section_type": "definition",
      "content": [
        "物质的有些性质不需要发生化学变化就能表现出来，这类性质叫做物理性质"
      ],
      "source_refs": ["evidence:chem-grade8-all-in-one:1-1-1:physical-property"]
    },
    {
      "id": "essence",
      "title": "本质理解",
      "section_type": "essence",
      "content": [
        "物理性质是物质固有的属性，不需要通过化学反应就能观察或测量",
        "物理性质是区分和识别物质的重要依据"
      ],
      "source_refs": ["evidence:chem-grade8-all-in-one:1-1-1:physical-property"]
    },
    {
      "id": "key-points",
      "title": "核心要点",
      "section_type": "key_points",
      "content": [
        "常见的物理性质包括：颜色、气味、熔点、沸点、密度、硬度、导电性、导热性等"
      ],
      "source_refs": ["evidence:chem-grade8-all-in-one:1-1-1:physical-property"]
    },
    {
      "id": "examples",
      "title": "典型例子",
      "section_type": "example",
      "content": [
        "颜色：氧气是无色气体",
        "气味：氧气无气味",
        "密度：氧气的密度略大于空气",
        "溶解性：氧气不易溶于水"
      ],
      "source_refs": ["evidence:chem-grade8-all-in-one:1-1-1:physical-property", "evidence:chem-grade8-all-in-one:2-1-2:oxygen-properties"]
    },
    {
      "id": "misconceptions",
      "title": "易混辨析",
      "section_type": "misconception",
      "content": [
        "物理性质与化学性质的区别：物理性质不需要发生化学变化就能表现，化学性质需要在化学变化中表现"
      ],
      "source_refs": ["evidence:chem-grade8-all-in-one:1-1-1:physical-property", "evidence:chem-grade8-all-in-one:1-1-1:chemical-property"]
    }
  ],
